00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:47,820
They can afford to be weak so long as their leader is powerful.

274
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:52,480
I see that you fight by surrounding yourself with lightning magic.

275
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,080
How very resourceful of you.

276
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,040
Your attacks must pack quite a punch.

277
00:13:58,020 --> 00:13:59,180
You're fast, as well.

278
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:01,880
And all of that is fed by your youthful vigor.

279
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:02,920
My.

280
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:05,360
You got this old man scared, all right.

281
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:06,560
And what about you, then?

282
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,260
What magic do you fight with?

283
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:09,100
Hmm.

284
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:10,560
Goodness.

285
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,200
You are an eager one, aren't you?

286
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:18,480
I'm assuming you Clover folks came in search of the dungeon's treasure hall, too.

287
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:21,180
Yeah.

288
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:22,360
Now let's fight!

289
00:14:22,700 --> 00:14:23,580
Oh, I don't know.

290
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:26,920
I mean, it's not like we really need to fight.

291
00:14:27,060 --> 00:14:28,840
We could just have a nice, friendly foot race.

292
00:14:28,940 --> 00:14:30,660
No violence or bloodshed necessary.

293
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:31,580
What do you think?

294
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,060
It sounds like a good idea to me.

295
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,020
Come on, let's go.

296
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:34,640
Get away!

297
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,400
Fast indeed.

298
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:39,360
Touch.

299
00:14:40,500 --> 00:14:41,000
Smoke?

300
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:45,400
Oh, I'm terribly frightened.

301
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:46,600
Hmm.

302
00:14:47,260 --> 00:14:50,380
I can understand why your people would be so angry with mine.

303
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:53,820
Obviously, no one likes having their country invaded.

304
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,080
I don't blame you.

305
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:55,980
Truly.

306
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:59,520
And we of the Diamond Kingdom apologize for the inconvenience.

307
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:04,720
It's just, we found ourselves running low on resources, you know?

308
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:07,280
What choice do we have if we want to live?

309
00:15:07,280 --> 00:15:09,680
Living can be so very hard.

310
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:14,300
See, I have three daughters of my own I need to provide for.

311
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:15,160
Oh, yeah?

312
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:22,720
Whatever, old man.

313
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:25,880
I'm just happy to finally be fighting somebody powerful.

314
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,660
You're a real piece of work.

315
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:30,700
You know that, right?

316
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:34,080
You may reduce me to tears.

317
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:43,420
What's with this place?

318
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:45,300
The gravity's gone haywire.

319
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:48,300
Hey, bird brain, are you sure this is the right way?

320
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,400
Come on!

321
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:51,260
Nero!

322
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,060
Wake up!

323
00:15:53,060 --> 00:15:58,000
Look at that!

324
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:58,840
It's treasure!

325
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,480
It definitely is not!

326
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,420
Don't go after it!

327
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:07,180
Only a complete idiot wouldn't see that it's a trap.

328
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:08,500
All right!

329
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:09,620
Got you now.

330
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:10,220
Stop!

331
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,240
Don't open it!

332
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:14,920
My sweet treasure chest!

333
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,100
What's inside of you?

334
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,240
Will you let it go?

335
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:19,400
What are you going to do if it's a trap?

336
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:20,820
And open!

337
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:29,260
Why didn't you just make me look at, you jerk?

338
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:32,260
It's not like I knew what was...

339
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:41,200
You're quite a hot-blooded youth.

340
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:43,820
It's no fun if you just dodge my attacks.

341
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:44,500
Fight back!

342
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:45,800
Well?

343
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,720
Oh, come on!

344
00:16:48,580 --> 00:16:48,940
Phew.

345
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:53,960
Ah, yes.

346
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,220
I remember that, Rogue.

347
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,720
You're a black bull, aren't you?

348
00:16:56,720 --> 00:17:00,100
I actually had the dubious honor of fighting your captain once.

349
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,540
He was a spitfire like you.

350
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:03,380
Wow!

351
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:05,180
You really know Captain Yami?

352
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,220
I'm not likely to forget him either.

353
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:11,440
Not after he left me such a splendid memento.

354
00:17:12,140 --> 00:17:14,140
Wet my pants and ran as fast as I could.

355
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,700
Now, that was truly a scary fellow.

356
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:20,180
He had a rather unique fighting style.

357
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:24,140
He was the only person younger than me who I couldn't defeat.

358
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:25,720
You're totally worth fighting!

359
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,720
Oh?

360
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:35,100
You don't look well, something wrong?

361
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,100
Nothing.

362
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:37,280
I'm fine.

363
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,880
Too slow.

364
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:45,700
Down you go now.

365
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,880
Nice and easy.

366
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:48,900
Down into the abyss.

367
00:17:49,460 --> 00:17:50,500
What's going on?

368
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:51,620
A spell?

369
00:17:51,620 --> 00:17:52,620
Oh, but...

370
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:54,860
I don't remember being hit with anything.

371
00:17:58,460 --> 00:18:01,920
You see, I have something to confess.

372
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:04,260
The air in here is full of my magic power.

373
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:08,880
An extremely thin smoke, too thin for the eye to see.

374
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:12,620
Oh, and in case you're interested, it's called weakening smoke magic.

375
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,540
Garden of plundering smoke.

376
00:18:14,540 --> 00:18:15,540
My body...

377
00:18:15,540 --> 00:18:17,960
It's not moving right...

378
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:21,800
Magic that reduces physical ability.

379
00:18:22,420 --> 00:18:23,540
But when did he...

380
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:26,960
Visible attacks can only do so much.

381
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:29,180
They're easy enough for an opponent to dodge.

382
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:32,020
I opted for a more subtle approach.

383
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:35,800
So I used every last drop of my magic power and cast it stealthily.

384
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:41,240
Fighting off my underlings provided a more than adequate distraction.

385
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:47,820
Their defeat was regrettable, but it wasn't in vain.

386
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:51,400
Their sacrifice gave me the opportunity to work my magic.

387
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:57,360
You know, it truly is vital.

388
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:58,880
Teamwork.

389
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:09,260
We're almost there now.

390
00:19:09,260 --> 00:19:11,440
It should be just through this hallway.

391
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:22,360
Isn't that simply marvelous?

392
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,480
Some dungeon that was.

393
00:19:24,860 --> 00:19:26,040
Not much to it at all.

394
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:30,800
So what's your plan for getting past this?

395
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:34,300
It doesn't appear as if the Black Bulls have managed to find it yet.

396
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:35,680
Of course they haven't.

397
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:39,020
Despite their bluster, they never stood a chance of beating us here.

398
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:40,720
You're probably right.

399
00:19:47,340 --> 00:19:48,020
Mimosa!

400
00:19:48,020 --> 00:19:53,520
It pierced through her cloak of magical defense.

401
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:58,120
Such a keen mana sense, but she never saw it coming.

402
00:19:58,900 --> 00:19:59,700
She's still alive.

403
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:03,600
This is no trap magic.

404
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:05,600
So, what is it?

405
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:12,080
Who goes there?

406
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:15,680
You're in my way.

407
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:19,700
Now move.

408
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,900
See what you really need.

409
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:24,140
Our friends, you know you can count on.

410
00:20:25,820 --> 00:20:28,620
Well, sorry about this, but I've got things to do.

411
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:29,740
You know how it is.

412
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:34,580
Win.

413
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:39,280
Win.

414
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:44,180
Keep on winning.

415
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:45,040
Luck.

416
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:50,240
Hold on.

417
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:56,040
It's been too long.

418
00:20:57,380 --> 00:20:59,320
Since things have gotten this interesting.

419
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:15,220
Oh, yeah.

420
00:21:16,280 --> 00:21:17,280
Let's do this.

421
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:18,680
Time to fight.

422
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:21,480
So much potential.

423
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:24,160
I'm almost sorry to extinguish it.

424
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:54,140
Let's do this.

425
00:21:54,660 --> 00:21:56,580
I can find a place to go.

426
00:21:56,580 --> 00:22:01,780
消えそうな光でも闇を照らす力が

427
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:06,400
繋がって時の流れを変える

428
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:09,200
I'm living in me

429
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:12,640
色褪せない場所に

430
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:14,740
Brain for yourself

431
00:22:14,740 --> 00:22:18,340
終わらない夢を掴むため

432
00:22:18,340 --> 00:22:21,040
進むべき道があるなら

433
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:22,500
Do you wanna drive?

434
00:22:22,580 --> 00:22:23,360
Do you wanna drive?

435
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:25,900
このままどこまででも

436
00:22:25,900 --> 00:22:28,500
僕の命が終わるまで

437
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:31,300
どんな痛みも受け入れよう

438
00:22:31,300 --> 00:22:32,580
We can drive down.

439
00:22:32,660 --> 00:22:33,500
We can drive down.

440
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:37,620
たとえ明日が見えなくても

441
00:22:37,620 --> 00:22:40,120
声にならない

442
00:22:40,120 --> 00:22:42,920
想いを抱いて

443
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:45,620
叫び続ける

444
00:22:45,620 --> 00:22:58,120
ご視聴ありがとうございました

445
00:22:58,120 --> 00:23:00,500
Clover Cliffs

446
00:23:00,500 --> 00:23:03,260
A lotus

447
00:23:03,260 --> 00:23:04,200
that won't bloom

448
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,740
is just another water lily

449
00:23:05,740 --> 00:23:06,660
See

450
00:23:06,660 --> 00:23:08,320
I have three daughters

451
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:08,920
of my own

452
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:10,120
I need to provide for

453
00:23:10,120 --> 00:23:12,000
When I'm all grown up

454
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:13,120
I'm gonna marry daddy

455
00:23:13,120 --> 00:23:14,700
My girls dote on me

456
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:15,280
but of course

457
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:15,960
there's no telling

458
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,240
how long that will last

459
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:18,380
Oh yes

460
00:23:18,380 --> 00:23:19,960
I can just hear it now

461
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:21,320
Go away

462
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:22,980
We can take care

463
00:23:22,980 --> 00:23:23,880
of our own laundry

464
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:26,740
Teenagers are truly scary

465
00:23:26,740 --> 00:23:29,360
What a sad man

466
00:23:29,360 --> 00:23:30,440
Sounds like he could

467
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:31,360
really use a good fight

468
00:23:31,360 --> 00:23:32,140
to cheer him up

469
00:23:32,140 --> 00:23:34,240
Now forget about it

470
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:36,720
It's not over yet

471
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:37,660
Things are finally

472
00:23:37,660 --> 00:23:38,360
getting good

473
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:39,820
Let's play some more

474
00:23:39,820 --> 00:23:41,460
Let's see who dies first

475
00:23:41,460 --> 00:23:42,740
Okay old man

476
00:23:42,740 --> 00:23:45,420
Black Clover page 16

477
00:23:45,420 --> 00:23:46,180
Friends

478
00:23:46,180 --> 00:23:48,920
My magic is never giving up

